The checkin app will allow a coach to cancelan individual lesson, or any lessons that day. When canceling the coach will be asked if they want to release or hold the slots. 
    Hold: means they are coach held
    Release: means they are rebookable by othr students

The app needs to also have a sign in screen where the coach is validated that they are who they say they are. 


The app also needs to display the clients contact info at checkin

